  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the ttukbaegi earthenware cook pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the olive oil to the preheated pot and swirl it around.",
    "Add the sliced onion to the pot and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the genmaicha tea leaves to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced apple and pickles to the pot and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked cheese to the pot and cook until it is melted and charred.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper.",
    "Spoon the mixture onto the agave leaves.",
    "Serve the ploughmans lunch immediately.",
    "Note: this recipe is for refrigerator pickling/preserving only — store in the refrigerator and consume within 1 week. Do not water-bath can without an acid (vinegar or lemon juice)."
